          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉత్సవం — utsavaṁ — \"a public celebration; a festival\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "పట్టణంలో పెద్ద ఉత్సవం జరిగింది. paṭṭaṇaṁlō pedda utsavaṁ jarigindi. A big celebration took place in the town."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ఉత్సవాలు, utsavālu."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ఉత్సవం (utsavaṁ) is borrowed from Sanskrit utsava, \"an enterprise\", and later \"a festival\" (CDIAL 1876)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
